			"notes": "## solyanka v1.3.12\nFor Minecraft 26.2 — Fabric only.\n\n### Installation\n1. Install Fabric Loader 0.20.1 or newer for Minecraft 26.2.\n2. Install these dependencies for Minecraft 26.2:\n   - Fabric API\n   - Fabric Language Kotlin 1.14.2+kotlin.2.4.21 or newer\n   - owo-lib 0.13.1+26.2\n3. Download solyanka-1.3.12.jar from Assets below.\n4. Place it in your Minecraft instance's mods folder.\n5. Remove any older solyanka JAR before launching.\n\nJava 25 is required. Mod Menu is optional.\nOpen settings with /solyanka."
